### Criar novo cliente (Acesso Público)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/clients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Luis Gustavo",
  "email": "silva@gmail.com",
  "password": "654321",
  "phone": "11999999999"
}

### Listar todos os clientes (Requer ADMIN)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/clients
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Buscar cliente por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/clients/34
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}




### Criar novo profissional
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/professionals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Luis Gonzaga",
  "email": "json@gamil.com",
  "password": "adm12456",
  "phone": "11888888888",
  "specialty": "Unhas de Gel"
}

### Listar profissionais
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/professionals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar agendamento
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "clientId": 1,
  "professionalId": 1,
  "serviceId": 1,
  "dateTime": "2026-10-10T14:30:00"
}

### Criar um serviço (Requer ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alongamento de Unha",
  "description": "Corte, lixamento e esmaltação comum",
  "price": 50.00,
  "duration": 45
}


### Listar serviços
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/services
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json


### Buscar um serviço por ID
GET  {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/services/3
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Listar meus agendamentos (Cliente)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/appointments/client/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### Simular Pagamento
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "appointmentId": 1,
  "amount": 50.00,
  "paymentMethod": "PIX"
}

